      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "zhijun"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "show",
      "id": "lingchen",
      "expr": "02-blush",
      "position": "near"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "凌晨沒有答。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "岸上的走道那邊，一隻大犬瞪著他們。後面又冒出一個黑影。另一頭。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "兩頭狗吼了一聲。"
